ent-WFRemadeCutter = plasma cutter
    .desc = A cutting torch that throws a short arc of plasma. Made for hull plating. It takes limbs off the Remade in a few shots, and it burns away corruption. It needs a charge.
ent-WFNecrotoxinPen = necrotoxin pen
    .desc = One dose of necrotoxin in an injector. Poison for the Remade. Stab a Remade with it, or a body you don't want getting back up.
ent-WFFlatpackMonolithTap = monolith tap flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack for a monolith tap. Unpack it, bolt it down within reach of a Scion and set the draw.
ent-WFMonolithHusk = dead monolith
    .desc = A black stone, split and cold. Whatever was in it has gone.
ent-WFMonolithPrimeHusk = dead Prime
    .desc = A black tower, split down its length and cold. Whatever was in it has gone.

reagent-name-wf-necrotoxin = necrotoxin
reagent-desc-wf-necrotoxin = A thick brown poison. It does little to the living and a lot to the Remade. A body with it in the blood does not get back up.
reagent-physical-desc-wf-necrotoxin = thick and foul

wf-prime-bounty-name = The Prime Monolith
wf-prime-bounty-author = Sector Watch
wf-prime-bounty-place-unknown = unknown
wf-prime-bounty-description = A Monolith has rooted at {$place}. Destroy it. Fire, a plasma cutter and necrotoxin work on its Remade. Only blasts and heavy cutting hurt the Monolith itself. Paid to whoever brings it down, by how much damage they dealt.
wf-prime-bounty-paid = The Prime is down. Sector Watch has paid {$amount} spesos into your account.
wf-prime-verse-announcement = All ships: the Prime is still standing. It has sung {$verse} times. More is coming. It will keep coming until the Monolith is destroyed.
wf-prime-fallen-announcement = All ships: the Prime has been destroyed. Its corruption is dying. The {$freed} Remade still alive are cut loose, hurt and slower, and will waste away if they are not killed. Do not let them reach anyone.

guide-entry-wf-remade = The Monolith and the Remade
guide-entry-wf-remade-monolith = The Monolith and its Gifts
guide-entry-wf-remade-fighting = Fighting the Remade
guide-entry-wf-remade-ending = Ending an outbreak
